@startuml client_connection_send_wait_reply_activity
title ClientConnection - sending and waiting for a reply

start
:SendWaitReply(message, reply);
if (IsInCallback()?) then (yes)
    :Return EAGAIN without blocking the engine callback thread;
    stop
else (no)
    :Call is outside engine callback context;
endif
:Delegate to ClientSendQueue::SendWaitReply(message, reply);
:Return the helper completion result unchanged;
stop

legend
    Callback-context rejection precedes helper validation and waiting.
    ClientSendQueue owns the current blocking request/reply implementation.
    A native lifetime-only transaction option remains future work.
endlegend

@enduml